# Mapping can grow a nested list beyond the input bound.

```catala
declaration scope NestedGrowth:
  input xs content list of integer
  output result content boolean

scope NestedGrowth:
  definition result equals
    if (exists ys among
          (map each x among (list of x among xs such that x > 0)
           to [x; 0 - x])
        such that (exists y among ys such that y < 0))
    then true else false
```
